  "description": "Tipping / incentive / SDPKT-settlement layer for the Aether mesh networking protocol. On-device tip queueing with regulated per-traffic-type policies and daily caps, batch sync to the backend, node-operator registration and reputation, tipper QoS tiers, XP reward queueing, the typed backend API bridge, and the SDPKT host implementation of the protocol-level mesh-tip settlement hook. Anyone with an SDPKT wallet can use it — wallet client, not a secret.",
